{
  "title": "Jagged Savory Ethiopian Cheese Azifa",
  "description": "A savory Ethiopian cheese dish featuring chopped chive and toast, perfect for a solo dinner, this ayurvedic-tamasic-friendly azifa is a delicious and satisfying meal.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
